<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 1.63 points off FTSE 100.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 1.63 points off FTSE 100.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks are trading ex-dividend on April 21, taking 1.63 points off the index, FTSE International said on Monday.</p>
<p>						  DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>						  (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		 COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>	* RMC Group			    18.70  23.38    0.353</p>
<p>	* Reed International		 18.95  23.69    0.787</p>
<p>	* Rolls Royce			   3.30   4.13    0.356</p>
<p>	* Smiths Industries		   6.15   7.69    0.137</p>
<p>	 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
